    "type": "game",
    "name": "Steel Judgment",
    "steam_appid": 3394690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/6e34c28be804c50ea559c70757d08725.avif?t=1749188552\" data-has-big width=800 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Judgment is a <strong>roguelike movement shooter\u00a0all about expressive and chaotic combat.</strong>\u00a0Inspired by games\u00a0like <i>ULTRAKILL </i>and\u00a0<i>Risk of Rain 2</i>, the game combines the expressive combat of a spectacle fighter with the unhinged chaos of a roguelike into one action-packed first-person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an advanced combat shell named Orpheus on a mission to hunt down the tyrant behind the invasion of your home world. However, it seems this war stretches beyond just your realm and theirs...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Venture through the realms and tear through your enemies</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a series of hand-crafted zones filled with distinct enemy types and intense boss fights inspired by character-action &amp; fighting games. Use a wide range of mobility options and attacks to stylishly mow them down, and<i> taunt</i>\u00a0them to keep yourself alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Discover and master unique weapons and items</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon in Steel Judgment has a unique design with deep synergies and mechanics for you to master. Likewise, items also provide powerful passive or active effects for you to create world-shattering builds with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Steal enemy abilities by countering them</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countering an enemy will rip the essence from their attack, allowing you to copy their moves! Your essence attacks synergize with your weapons as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unleash combos with a diverse and versatile moveset</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steel Judgment,<i> taunt-cancelling</i>\u00a0allows you to empower various actions in your moveset. Jumping turns into an uppercut, punches become stronger with more knockback, and more! Use these moves in conjunction with your weapons to combo enemies as far as your imagination can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strength in numbers your enemies may have, but a legion of prey is no match for your might. All who stand in your path shall face Steel Judgment!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/6e34c28be804c50ea559c70757d08725.avif?t=1749188552\" data-has-big width=800 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Judgment is a <strong>roguelike movement shooter\u00a0all about expressive and chaotic combat.</strong>\u00a0Inspired by games\u00a0like <i>ULTRAKILL </i>and\u00a0<i>Risk of Rain 2</i>, the game combines the expressive combat of a spectacle fighter with the unhinged chaos of a roguelike into one action-packed first-person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an advanced combat shell named Orpheus on a mission to hunt down the tyrant behind the invasion of your home world. However, it seems this war stretches beyond just your realm and theirs...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Venture through the realms and tear through your enemies</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a series of hand-crafted zones filled with distinct enemy types and intense boss fights inspired by character-action &amp; fighting games. Use a wide range of mobility options and attacks to stylishly mow them down, and<i> taunt</i>\u00a0them to keep yourself alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Discover and master unique weapons and items</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon in Steel Judgment has a unique design with deep synergies and mechanics for you to master. Likewise, items also provide powerful passive or active effects for you to create world-shattering builds with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Steal enemy abilities by countering them</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countering an enemy will rip the essence from their attack, allowing you to copy their moves! Your essence attacks synergize with your weapons as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unleash combos with a diverse and versatile moveset</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steel Judgment,<i> taunt-cancelling</i>\u00a0allows you to empower various actions in your moveset. Jumping turns into an uppercut, punches become stronger with more knockback, and more! Use these moves in conjunction with your weapons to combo enemies as far as your imagination can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strength in numbers your enemies may have, but a legion of prey is no match for your might. All who stand in your path shall face Steel Judgment!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.poster.avif?t=1749188552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.webm?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.mp4?t=1749188552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
